{"server":"en","storyId":"act12d0_level_act12d0_ex01_end","groupId":"act12d0","stageId":"act12d0_ex01","title":"Feint","storyCode":"RI-EX-1","avgTag":"After Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_ex01_end.txt","sourceHash":"2d3eb11546598507f5eceeea08bf1e9b30a7812deaacab981019e8d451ab6215","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"The scorching sun, the wilds, the golden sand, and the warm breeze! Woohoo! I feel a new song coming on!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"（solo）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Could the both of you quiet down?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Please. It's not often we get such a peaceful environment with no one chasing us. Can't we just have a nice, quiet rest?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"But Alty, I can smell the sea from here. Are you sure we're safe?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Aya, could you not spoil the mood for once?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Nowhere in the world is truly safe, but we have to learn to let ourselves relax sometimes."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Maybe you're right."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"So what's the next step? How are we going to broaden our path? We can't go back empty-handed."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"At least that doctor gave us an answer this time."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"Alty looks at the 'key' in her hand."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Really? That looks like something special. And she just gave it to you? What did you trade for it?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Knowledge."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"And was that a fair trade?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm not sure. But I think that doctor wants us to put this knowledge to use."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Wouldn't she know?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"We know a lot, she should just..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"...If you think about it, the real trade was her using our curiosity to get us to act."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"So, that means she didn't pay anything?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Hm..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Hm..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"We've been cheated."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"More like baited."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Directed?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Guided."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Is that doctor really so important?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"No. I think she's trying to tell us that her actions have no impact at all."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"What matters is what we think and what we do."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Then what about the key? Should we go?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Ugh, this sucks. Could we not go?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm thinking it's sort of like music... Our power should not be to force change onto others, we should just be singing our own songs."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Sing for them. If it sounds good—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Then they'll sing too."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"（solo）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Hah, then we will give even more knowledge, and the key, over to the one who is ready."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"And who will that be?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"I don't know."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Maybe they haven't been born yet."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"That would be great!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"No it wouldn't, Dan. We... hm?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"What is it, Alty?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"The car's dead."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Didn't you prep it?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Yes, but we took that detour."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"And I have to admit, it's really easy to lose your heading in the middle of the wilderness with no roads or signs."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"So basically, we're lost?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm not sure that's how I'd put it. It's not so much that we're off course as it is we're carving a new path."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"We're lost."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"We're lost! That's a pretty good theme."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"You know, Dan, I really wish I could learn some of your optimism. So what are we going to do?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"It looks like there's a rainforest over that way. Let's check it out."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"So, who's getting out to push?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"We could take turns."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungleentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Alty."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"What?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"We've got a crowd here."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Yes, we do."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"But I don't know what language they're speaking."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"So should we just let them follow us?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Do you have a better idea?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"We could kill them all?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"You think you can get Frost and Dan to go along with that?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"(Strumming and singing)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Archosauria A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"&*......%$ ....& (W-What is this sound? And why do I like it so much?!)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Archosauria B","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"&%......% (I've never heard anything like it...)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Hey, how is everybody?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Can you tell me what language you're speaking?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Oh, but I guess even if you told me, I still wouldn't know."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Archosauria C","speakerId":"avg_npc_073","isRemote":false,"text":"......%&$ (Where did they come from?!)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Archosauria D","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"$......&# (And why does this one look so weird?)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Well, at least there are people here."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"I just hope there's a place we can resupply."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Wishful thinking."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Eunectes","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"You're outsiders?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Huh? You speak Sargonian?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Eunectes","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"Yes, it looks like you're definitely outsiders."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Eunectes","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"What are you doing here?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Our car died, so we're looking for someone with the Arts to recharge it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Eunectes","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"...Come with me."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"See, Aya, that was more than just wishful thinking."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Fine. I guess the world is a magical place."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_village_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Hey hey hey! What's this?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"There's a village here in the middle of this primeval forest!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"(Humming)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"It's really amazing. You can see the influence of modern architecture on most of the buildings, but they still have that primitive beauty."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"It's odd, but very special."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Eunectes","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"I am the leader of this tribe, Zumama. Most of my people can understand your language."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Eunectes","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"I can have some of our priests recharge your vehicle, but there are terms."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"What terms?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Eunectes","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"I want to look inside your vehicle, at its structure."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"...Is that all?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Eunectes","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"Yes."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Are you sure you won't break it?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Eunectes","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm pretty sure."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Alty?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"It's not like we have a choice."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Eunectes","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"So...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Agreed."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Eunectes","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"Good. High Priest..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"High Priest","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm here! ...Oh?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"High Priest","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"Hmmmmm....?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"High Priest","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"I know of you..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"I know of you..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"I never expected to see your kind here."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"High Priest","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"Oh, honestly, I was thinking the exact same thing."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"High Priest","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"But I'm more interested in your vehicle than you!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"By all means."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"I said it before and I'll say it again. The world is a magical place."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"I have to say, I agree."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"At the same time, Frost hooks her guitar up to the ceremonial speaker and improvises a solo."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Nice, Frost."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"This village is inspiring me."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Awesome, Frost, you really switched up the melody this time."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Heat, repressed..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"I'll call this song... 'D'!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Archosauria A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Where's that sound coming from?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Archosauria B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"What is it?I can feel it energizing me!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Archosauria C","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"It must be the outsiders who just came! Let's go see!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"There are more of them, Alty..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"That's not good."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"These lives thirst for music! For energy! For..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Archosauria B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"What a voice!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Archosauria C","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Outsider, give us more music!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Alty... I know it's unexpected, but I think the atmosphere here is actually really good."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Why don't we get out the amps and play together?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"I guess that would be fine."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Yeah, can't let Frost take all the glory!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"I gotta get in on such a badass track!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Then let the locals feel the music of AUS!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Archosauria A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"It's just a few notes, but I'm too excited to sit still!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Archosauria B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"It might be like what the priests do, it's called 'music'?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Archosauria C","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"I've never heard anything like it! Who are these people?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Archosauria D","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"I know, they must be 'Cuicayotl'!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"'Cuicayotl'? What's that?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"High Priest","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"Oh, that's how you say 'one who sings' in their language."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"High Priest","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"But it's been a long time since they had a 'Cuicayotl' here, and you've won them over with your music."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"High Priest","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"And I must say, your music is vastly different from that of any other 'Cuicayotl' I've ever heard before!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"High Priest","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"But no matter. I find yours a lot more fun!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Archosauria E","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"'Cuicayotl', give us another song!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Archosauria F","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"I'll give you anything! Just one more song!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"What do we do, Alty?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Let's stay here, Alty!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Well, I can't let you forget our goal..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"But, fine. We've got time."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungle_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"I never imagined there would be a Messenger here."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Inam","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"And I never thought AUS, from all the magazine covers, would show up here either."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Where's Zumama?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Inam","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"She's making the speaker system you asked for. So I'll be taking you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Inam","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"How long are you going to stay?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Maybe a week, maybe a month, maybe a whole year."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"This place is doing it for us. I think we can have some fun here, at least."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Inam","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"Then this is the right place for you to put on a show."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_temple_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"So cool!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"It's... some kind of temple?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Inam","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"That's right. This is where all the tribes used to gather for the 'Mahuizzotia', but it hasn't been used since Gavial left."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"'Mahuizzotia'?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Gavial? That name came up at Rhodes Island... No, it's probably just a common name."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Inam","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"You can perform here."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"We're going to give the people the best music they've ever heard."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Yes, hahaha! Yes! We'll leave the mark of AUS right here!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_village_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"Two months later..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Inam","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"AUS is unbelievable..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Inam","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"They actually did stay for two whole months."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Inam","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"If Gavial ever comes back, she's going to be blown away by the music we have way out here now."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Inam","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"The people fell in love with their rock and roll."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Inam","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"So what are they going to perform for us today?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Inam","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"...I wonder maybe if I'm their biggest fan."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Inam","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"AUS..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Inam","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"Huh?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"The room is empty. All the toiletries and bedding are neat and tidy, with a piece of paper resting on the table in the center."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Inam","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"They're gone?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Inam","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"There's a note on the table. Let's see..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Inam","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"'We left. Don't miss us. I hope you enjoyed the music. Also, we left all our records here for you. Have fun. -AUS'"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Inam","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"...Heh, they really are unbelievable."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"I don't think I'll ever forget that Acahualla place."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"(Humming) It was definitely unforgettable."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"But the people there are really noisy, and wild."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Yeah? I love them!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Of course you do. I don't think you'd mind if we left you there."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"I was definitely thinking about it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't you think those people have a kind of natural, primal energy?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Out of all the countries and cities we've been to, I've never seen people like that."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"I love 'em!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Well, you're right about that much."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"They really get our music. They're the best audience we've ever had."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"I think Frost likes them too."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"But we can't just show up and flip a whole civilization upside-down. We should stick to singing."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Sing for them. If it sounds good—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Then they'll sing too."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Didn't we say that before?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Who knows? We might've said it a million times already."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"Let's go. Continue on our journey."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty_rock","isRemote":false,"text":"If we sing to the world, will she listen?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"A few of the bandmates joke around for a bit, until the car goes silent.\nAlty looks at the key in her hand, 'Dr. Kal'tsit, can that Rhodes Island of yours give the world the answer it's looking for?'"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_416_zumama","aliases":["Eunectes"]}]}
